Third-party material
====================

OpenNord (AGPL-3.0-or-later)
  https://github.com/simonflore/opennord, commit ed66f7f.
  nordconv/_layout_ns3.py, _layout_ns4.py, _tables_ns3.py and _tables_ns4.py
  are generated from OpenNord's TypeScript tables by tools/gen_layouts.py.
  The CBIN container rules, block-chain decoding, Stage 3 format fix-ups
  (nordconv/source.py) and parts of the mapping follow OpenNord's code
  (src/lib/clavia, src/lib/ns3, src/lib/ns4, src/lib/migrate).

ns4decode by Randy, with ns4gui by guyd789 (MIT)
  OpenNord's Stage 4 offset map, value tables and name tables, which reach
  nordconv/_layout_ns4.py and nordconv/_tables_ns4.py, are ported from
  ns4decode. templates/regressionTest.ns4p is ns4decode's regression fixture.

