ns3-program-viewer by Christian Florentz (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  https://github.com/chris55/ns3-program-viewer, commit 55105f4.
  Consulted as format documentation for the Stage 3; no code is copied into
  the converter or the web app. web/test/fixtures/ns3/ holds copies of its
  test fixtures (the .ns3f programs in its test/ns3 folder), unchanged. They
  are test data only: the web engine's parity test reads them, and
  web/test/golden/golden.json holds the Python converter's results for them,
  plus damaged and edited variants of one of them as test inputs.
  They are not part of the converter, the web build or its output. Their
  licence is web/test/fixtures/ns3/LICENSE-ns3-program-viewer.

